From 01743ad74daed578d8afb1a1da3c1a4ccb11fdcc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tbrasselle <tbrasselle@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:12:52 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(examples): refresh the guide-multiaxis cached toolpath to
 the #3080 behaviour

The Indexed Face1 cache in examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj kept the
pre-#3080 FirstTraverseLow warning in the local frame of the tilted
plane (height_mm 10.0, top_mm 11.114, tilted false). The file was
regenerated through its own headless path (open_project, generate of
Indexed Face1, save_project), so the cache now holds the warning in the
user frame: height_mm 30.0, top_mm 31.114, tilted true. The raise is
the same 1.114 mm. The Swarf1 cache is untouched.

Pinned by guide_projects::indexed_guide_preserves_legacy_basis_and_path
and guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths.

Fixes #3234
---
 examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj b/examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj
index 5b9a17edf..2e56e2828 100644
--- a/examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj
+++ b/examples/guide-multiaxis.camproj
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 {
-  "version": 73,
+  "version": 76,
   "machine": {
     "path": "built-in: Tilt-head 5-axis",
     "machine": {
@@ -6468,9 +6468,10 @@
             {
               "first_traverse_low": {
                 "at": 0,
-                "height_mm": 10.0,
-                "top_mm": 11.113929111364872,
-                "fixture": false
+                "height_mm": 30.0,
+                "top_mm": 31.11392911136487,
+                "fixture": false,
+                "tilted": true
               }
             },
             {
